London Bridge

When you emerge from the lair you are momentarily disoriented, blinking your eyes in the bright sunlight. After a few moments, you realize you are standing on London bridge, but you have no idea from which direction you came.

The detective trails along after you.

You notice that the sun has risen... as much as it ever does in England.

